ty App launched" class="newsImage-ubJ2i"/><div class="content-ZoQGf"><div><div class="newsTitle-y72jg">IP allowlist for third party App launched</div><div class="desc---lzv">To reduce risks, we support connecting the API Key of clients to the server IP set by brokers</div></div><div class="time-lxXT1">01/05/2023</div></div></a></div><div class="readMore-DawAE"><a href="/help/section/product-documentation-broker" rel="nofollow" data-testid="okd-button" data-e2e-okd-aslink-loading="false" target="" data-e2e-okd-button-loading="false" type="button" class="oxnv-powerLink-a11y oxnv oxnv-button-var oxnv-btn btn-lg btn-outline-primary readMoreBtn-fkgte"><span class="btn-content">Show more</span></a></div></div></div><div class="broker-advantage"><div class="broker-advantage-inner"><h1 class="broker-advantage-title">Why OKX Broker?</h1><div class="broker-advantage-content"><div class="advantage"><picture class="oxnv oxnv-picture oxnv-picture-font"><source data-testid="okd-image-source-media" media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/imgs/234/6897C57268C50F21.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_200,h_200,type_6/ignore-error,1"/><source data-testid="okd-image-source-media" media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)" srcSet="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/imgs/234/6897C57268C50F21.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_240,h_240,type_6/ignore-error,1"/><source data-testid="okd-image-source-media" media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1269px)" srcSet="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/imgs/234/6897C57268C50F21.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_304,h_304,type_6/ignore-error,1"/><img data-testid="okd-picture-img-default" class="advantage-icon" src="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/imgs/234/6897C57268C50F21.png" alt="Why OKX Broker?"/></picture><div><h2 class="advantage-title">Earn high commissions</h2><div class="advantage-desc">OKX Broker offers commission rates of up to 50%, with flexible allocation solutions.</div></div></div><div class="advantage"><pictur