e/earn/5.94.63/onchainAprChartContent.js"></script><script crossorigin="" src="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/okfe/comb-trade/3.346.67/strategyDialog.js"></script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What can an OKX broker get?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The OKX broker platform provides API trading, as well as various entrustment strategies (such as Grid and Iceberg), Earn products (such as Savings and Staking), and Convert. Our diverse broker services can help you quickly start your business."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I am an existing OKX API user. Can I apply for an OKX affiliate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Brokers should have an independent product system so that users can place orders on the broker's platform via API. You can apply once qualified."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the OKX broker platform differentiate between new and old users?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We currently don't distinguish between new and old users and all brokers can enjoy commission. New and old just refers to whether or not a user's registration date is earlier than the date when the broker connected to OKX. If it's earlier, a user is considered old, and if it's later, a user is considered new."}}]}</script><script type="module" crossorigin="" src="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/okfe/broker-center/assets/broker-BHO0ZCZf.js"></script><script crossorigin="" async src="https://www.okx.com/cdn/assets/okfe/okx-nav/footer/index.d76523c8.js"></script><script type="text/javascript">(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start': new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0], j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src= 'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-5RX47XK');</script><noscript><iframe